    <string name="about_guide_section_how_to_use">How to Use the App</string>
    <string name="about_guide_body_how_to_use">1. Set Lyra as your Default Phone &amp; Caller ID/Spam app so incoming and outgoing calls route cleanly through Lyra.\n2. Use the Dialpad tab to select Ask / SIM 1 / SIM 2, enter digits, tap the Dialpad bottom button to toggle the keypad over your contacts list, or swipe down on suggestions to browse all contacts.\n3. Manage calls from the lock screen, floating banner, or in-call controls (Mute, Audio Output, Keypad, Hold, Add Call &amp; Merge).\n4. Use Lyra AI Voicemail to screen callers with a custom greeting and review transcripts &amp; summaries, or schedule exact automatic calls.</string>

    <string name="about_guide_section_settings">Available Settings</string>
    <string name="about_guide_body_settings">• Appearance &amp; Theme: Switch between iOS Glass, Liquid Dark, and Pure Light styles plus custom dashboard hero artwork.\n• Unknown Call Blocker: Toggle automatic screening or blocking for unknown numbers and commercial telemarketing prefixes.\n• AI Engine &amp; Voicemail: Configure Firebase AI Logic / Gemini or OpenAI-compatible models, API keys, and custom voicemail greetings.\n• Call Screen &amp; Alerts: Customize screen style, animations, full-screen lock-screen alerts, persistent notifications, vibration, and ringtone.\n• Dual-SIM &amp; Cloud Backup: Pin a default SIM slot and sign in with Google to back up and restore priority contacts.</string>

    <string name="about_guide_section_recommended">Recommended / Best Settings</string>
    <string name="about_guide_body_recommended">• Enable Default Dialer, Call Screening Role, Notifications, Display Over Other Apps, and Exact Alarms.\n• Set Battery Optimization to \"Don\'t optimise\" / Unrestricted so scheduled calls and background incoming alerts never sleep.\n• Keep Background Call Guard, Persistent Notification, and Full-Screen Incoming Screen enabled for reliable lock-screen pickup.\n• Turn on Show Contact Photos and Haptic/Vibration Feedback for faster caller recognition.</string>

    <string name="about_guide_section_dos_donts">Do\'s &amp; Don\'ts</string>
    <string name="about_guide_body_dos_donts">Do:\n• Keep Exact Alarm &amp; Notification permissions granted for scheduled calls and missed-call badges.\n• Configure SIM preference (Ask / SIM 1 / SIM 2) before scheduling automatic calls.\n\nDon\'t:\n• Do not restrict Lyra in OEM Battery Saver or force-stop background services during an active call.\n• Do not deny Microphone permission if you plan to capture caller voicemails.</string>

    <string name="about_guide_section_framework">Usage Framework</string>
    <string name="about_guide_body_framework">• UI &amp; State: Jetpack Compose (Material 3) with unidirectional StateFlow ViewModels and lifecycle-aware collection.\n• Telecom Core: Android InCallService, CallScreeningService, CallEndpoint / CallAudioState routing, and Foreground Service lifecycle.\n• Persistence: Room SQLite database for voicemails, notes, summaries, priority tags &amp; scheduled calls; Preferences DataStore for settings.\n• Scheduling &amp; AI: Exact AlarmManager (setAlarmClock) handoff + Firebase AI Logic / local fallback.</string>

