    <string name="about_privacy_zero_cloud">Zero Cloud Leakage Guarantee</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_points">1. Lyra operates strictly offline and locally by default.\n2. Never uploads private contacts to external servers.\n3. Voicemail greetings and transcripts stay strictly private on this device.\n4. All notes, summaries, and priority tags stay on this device.\n5. Complies with Google Play policies and least-privilege standards.</string>
